Package: altdown
Title: A 'pkgdown'-Style Theme for 'altdoc' Websites
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-27
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Bjarke", family = "Hautop Kristensen", email = "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a theme and helper functions for building package
    websites with 'altdoc' and 'Quarto', styled to resemble 'pkgdown'
    while supporting 'Quarto' features such as callout blocks that
    'pkgdown' does not render correctly.
